> Wild garlic[ pesto shrimp] pasta[ is] a fresh and easy pasta dish made with sauteed shrimps, marinated[ in] flavourful wild[ garlic pesto]… Perfect for lunch or dinner[!]
[L]ately, I’ve been all about easy and quick lunch and dinner ideas, and this recipe is one of my all-time favourite recipes. This whole thing is ready in just 20 minutes, perfect for busy days or even date nights!
