> I am guilty[ of] being a nail extremist.
If you have the same[ aff]liction as me, you will agree that hands and nails are nothing to joke about and need to be taken as seriously as hair is by the hair-obsessives in this world. I am not one of those, thankfully[.] If you do not have[ this] condition you might find the following a little disconcerting.
